{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/6bd15078d404181ecc8b99da96524b19.poster.avif?t=1759330329\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/6bd15078d404181ecc8b99da96524b19.webm?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/6bd15078d404181ecc8b99da96524b19.mp4?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new approach to the genre of massively multiplayer games. We took the best of MMORPGs and reworked it for the modern player who values their time and engaging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/bc8f5b922b9e6149707ae1c8144c973b.poster.avif?t=1759330329\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/bc8f5b922b9e6149707ae1c8144c973b.webm?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/bc8f5b922b9e6149707ae1c8144c973b.mp4?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and trade, get rich, upgrade your base, character, and gear \u2014 become the most successful player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/cccea81b9087629c2d663d19270bd7fd.poster.avif?t=1759330329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/cccea81b9087629c2d663d19270bd7fd.webm?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/cccea81b9087629c2d663d19270bd7fd.mp4?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head into hardcore PvE missions for valuable materials or assemble a well-coordinated PvP team to claim rewards from every tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/82c841b94ad5e59cd0c9e6ab166e1109.poster.avif?t=1759330329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/82c841b94ad5e59cd0c9e6ab166e1109.webm?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/82c841b94ad5e59cd0c9e6ab166e1109.mp4?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst into large-scale clan wars, seize territories, earn a share of in-game commerce, and become the scourge of the entire server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/e6b95161f0c410632feefb330bd91025.poster.avif?t=1759330329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/e6b95161f0c410632feefb330bd91025.webm?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/e6b95161f0c410632feefb330bd91025.mp4?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METACRAFT: Arena offers a wide range o