 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head into hardcore PvE missions for valuable materials or assemble a well-coordinated PvP team to claim rewards from every tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/82c841b94ad5e59cd0c9e6ab166e1109.poster.avif?t=1759330329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/82c841b94ad5e59cd0c9e6ab166e1109.webm?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/82c841b94ad5e59cd0c9e6ab166e1109.mp4?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst into large-scale clan wars, seize territories, earn a share of in-game commerce, and become the scourge of the entire server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/e6b95161f0c410632feefb330bd91025.poster.avif?t=1759330329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/e6b95161f0c410632feefb330bd91025.webm?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/e6b95161f0c410632feefb330bd91025.mp4?t=1759330329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METACRAFT: Arena offers a wide range of PvP and PvE activities that flexibly adapt to your playstyle. Show everyone who the true champion is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/c7